- If it asks for the last four, enter the last four digits (e.g., 1234).
- If it asks for the full SSN, only provide it to trusted parties over secure channels (look for HTTPS, a known organization, a privacy policy). If you’re unsure, ask why they need the full SSN and whether the last four would suffice.

